Design System
Color palette: Deep charcoal #111111 and #161616 for dark sections, off-white #f8f7f4 for light sections, gold #d4af37 as the accent color throughout, white text #ffffff, muted text #888888 and #b8b8b8
Typography:Playfair Display (serif) for headings and display text, Inter (sans-serif) for all body copy, labels, and UI text. Load both from Google Fonts.
Style: Minimalist, corporate, executive-level. No shadows. Clean borders using #2a2a2a on dark sections, #e8e6e0 on light sections.
Buttons: Outlined white button and gold filled button side by side as CTAs. No rounded corners on hero buttons — sharp edges.
Cards:rounded-xl with border, no shadows.
Animations: Fade-up on scroll using IntersectionObserver for every section. Staggered delay on grid items. 1000ms duration.
