Case Study 01 — ERP Implementation:

Tag: ERP Implementation | Microsoft Dynamics 365
Title: Microsoft Dynamics 365 F&O Implementation for a Retail & Distribution Group
Context: Mid-sized Nigerian conglomerate, 6 subsidiaries, legacy ERP mix, 5000+ POs/month
Problem: 18–22 day month-end close, manual reconciliation, no group-level reporting
Approach: Fit-gap analysis, 3-phase roadmap, BPMN mapping of 24 processes, Azure DevOps
Solution: D365 F&O single-tenant across 6 subsidiaries, 12 Power BI dashboards, bank integration
Impact: 40% close reduction · 6→1 systems consolidated · ₦640M procurement savings · 91% UAT pass rate
Tools: Dynamics 365 F&O, Azure DevOps, Power BI, BPMN 2.0, Microsoft Excel
Case Study 02 — Process Redesign:

Tag: Business Process Redesign | BPMN | Lean
Title: Procurement Process Redesign for a Financial Services Organisation
Context: West Africa asset management firm, 2,400 requisitions/year, 9 procurement staff
Problem: 31-day avg cycle (benchmark: 12–15 days), redundant approvals, paper-based routing, maverick buying
Approach: AS-IS BPMN audit of 14 sub-processes, value stream analysis, redesign workshops, delegation of authority matrix
Solution: 4-tier approval workflow, Preferred Vendor Register, SharePoint PO-invoice matching, Excel SLA dashboard
Impact: 55% cycle reduction (31→14 days) · 9→4 approval steps · 78% maverick purchasing reduction · ₦180M vendor savings
Tools: BPMN 2.0, Lucidchart, Microsoft Visio, Microsoft Excel, SharePoint
Case Study 03 — Agile Delivery:

Tag: Product Management | Agile Delivery | Jira
Title: Agile Delivery of an Internal Operations Platform for a Professional Services Firm
Context: Big-4-affiliated firm, 9-month programme, 14-person squad, digitalizing onboarding/timesheet/staffing/leave
Problem: Stalled after 3 months, no increments delivered, poorly written backlog, no sprint visibility
Approach: Full backlog audit of 240 items, rewrote 80+ user stories to INVEST criteria, re-established Scrum ceremonies, Jira setup with epics/story points/sprints
Solution: 4 deployed modules in 6 months: Digital Onboarding, Staffing Portal, Timesheet, Leave Management
Impact: 3× velocity increase · 4 modules deployed · 65% sprint carryover reduction · 240+ items groomed in 3 weeks
Tools: Jira, Confluence, Microsoft Excel, Scrum / Kanban, BPMN 2.0
